      "writtenOn": "2022-03-17T03:14:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1) Hard hang on lid close\nAP will be reset. Since the lid is closed at login screen, the dut will shutdown. \n\n2) Hard hang on idle\nAP will be reset. DUT will be back at login screen and eventually shut down.\n\n3) Hard hang on lid open or key press wakeup\nScreen will be black and unresponsive for up to 30 seconds. AP will be reset and user will see the login screen. \n\n4) Consecutive Hard Hangs\nAP will be shutdown after 20 seconds. User will need to press power button to turn on.\n\nThinking through this more, since the DUT lands at the login screen after an ap reset, and the OS shuts down instead of sleeps if idle at login screen, there may not be a legitimate scenario where a hard S0i3 hang occurs consecutively...",
      "parentUuid": "20aa5912_d4874742",
      "revId": "513a4f929bc3c69d6d7eb603a19fe5c67b6e80cb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
